OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FChance of a few light showers
OL,6,Fat first. Otherwise it will be dry
OL,7,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and a
OL,8,Ffew sunny intervals, best of any
OL,9,Fsunshine across the west. Light
OL,10,Fnortheasterly wind.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry and
OL,13,Fpartly cloudy. Then becoming rather
OL,14,Fcloudy overnight with a few light
OL,15,Fshowers possible across eastern
OL,16,FAberdeenshire. Light and variable
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,18,
OL,19,CThursday:FMainly dry although rather
OL,20,Fcloudy at times. Chance of one or two
OL,21,Flight showers, mainly in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
